@@ -0,0 +1,949 @@
+/*
+ * Virtio MSG - Message packing/unpacking functions.
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2024 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
+ * Written by Edgar E. Iglesias <edgar.iglesias@amd.com>.
